# ============================================================
# orbit: leo_dawn_dusk -- sun-synchronous, 550 km, along the terminator
# ============================================================
# The plane faces the Sun (beta near 90 degrees), so the satellite is in
# sunlight the whole orbit: the hot case. Open it in the GUI's Plans tab to see
# it propagated on the wall clock (docs/ORBIT.md).
#
# Two-body motion: the plane does not turn with the Sun, so over weeks it
# drifts away from dawn-dusk. Move the epoch forward to start it again.

epoch 2026-10-05T12:00:00Z
a 6928 km
e 0.001
i 97.6 deg
raan 281.3 deg
argp 0 deg
nu 0 deg
